(1, 0, '{\"en\":\"FUNDAMENTALS  NURSING\",\"ar\":\"FUNDAMENTALS\",\"bn\":\"FUNDAMENTALS\",\"es\":\"FUNDAMENTALS\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses lay the foundation for all nursing practice, focusing on essential skills and knowledge every nurse must master. This course covers critical topics such as patient care, hygiene, mobility, safety, and communication, ensuring students develop a strong understanding of basic nursing principles. With hands-on training and theoretical learning, students learn how to provide compassionate, patient-centered care while upholding professional standards. Perfect for beginners, this course equips future nurses with the confidence and competence to excel in diverse healthcare settings, preparing them for advanced studies and real-world clinical practice.\",\"ar\":\"Fundamentals of Nursing This course lays the foundation for all nursing practice, focusing on essential skills and knowledge every nurse must master. This course covers critical topics such as patient care, hygiene, mobility, safety, and communication, ensuring students develop a strong understanding of basic nursing principles. With hands-on training and theoretical learning, students learn how to provide compassionate, patient-centered care while upholding professional standards. Perfect for beginners, this course equips future nurses with the confidence and competence to excel in diverse healthcare settings, preparing them for advanced studies and real-world clinical practice.\",\"bn\":\"Fundamentals of Nursing This course lays the foundation for all nursing practice, focusing on essential skills and knowledge every nurse must master. This course covers critical topics such as patient care, hygiene, mobility, safety, and communication, ensuring students develop a strong understanding of basic nursing principles. With hands-on training and theoretical learning, students learn how to provide compassionate, patient-centered care while upholding professional standards. Perfect for beginners, this course equips future nurses with the confidence and competence to excel in diverse healthcare settings, preparing them for advanced studies and real-world clinical practice.\",\"es\":\"Fundamentals of Nursing This course lays the foundation for all nursing practice, focusing on essential skills and knowledge every nurse must master. This course covers critical topics such as patient care, hygiene, mobility, safety, and communication, ensuring students develop a strong understanding of basic nursing principles. With hands-on training and theoretical learning, students learn how to provide compassionate, patient-centered care while upholding professional standards. Perfect for beginners, this course equips future nurses with the confidence and competence to excel in diverse healthcare settings, preparing them for advanced studies and real-world clinical practice.\"}', NULL, 0, 57, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:18:58', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 13),
(2, 0, '{\"en\":\"MEDICAL SURGICAL NURSING\",\"ar\":\"MEDICAL SURGICAL NURSING\",\"bn\":\"MEDICAL SURGICAL NURSING\",\"es\":\"MEDICAL SURGICAL NURSING\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses are designed to enhance your clinical skills in managing adult patients with various medical conditions and surgical interventions. You\\u2019ll dive deep into areas like cardiovascular, respiratory, gastrointestinal, and neurological systems, gaining practical knowledge to handle complex cases. With a focus on patient assessment, care planning, and post-operative care, you\'ll build a solid foundation for critical thinking and decision-making in fast-paced environments. Whether you\'re a nursing student or a practicing nurse looking to advance your expertise, this course equips you to provide exceptional, evidence-based care in a variety of healthcare settings.\",\"ar\":\"**Medical-Surgical Nursing Course**   This course is designed to enhance your clinical skills in managing adult patients with various medical conditions and surgical interventions. You\\u2019ll dive deep into areas like cardiovascular, respiratory, gastrointestinal, and neurological systems, gaining practical knowledge to handle complex cases. With a focus on patient assessment, care planning, and post-operative care, you\'ll build a solid foundation for critical thinking and decision-making in fast-paced environments. Whether you\'re a nursing student or a practicing nurse looking to advance your expertise, this course equips you to provide exceptional, evidence-based care in a variety of healthcare settings.\",\"bn\":\"**Medical-Surgical Nursing Course**   This course is designed to enhance your clinical skills in managing adult patients with various medical conditions and surgical interventions. You\\u2019ll dive deep into areas like cardiovascular, respiratory, gastrointestinal, and neurological systems, gaining practical knowledge to handle complex cases. With a focus on patient assessment, care planning, and post-operative care, you\'ll build a solid foundation for critical thinking and decision-making in fast-paced environments. Whether you\'re a nursing student or a practicing nurse looking to advance your expertise, this course equips you to provide exceptional, evidence-based care in a variety of healthcare settings.\",\"es\":\"**Medical-Surgical Nursing Course**   This course is designed to enhance your clinical skills in managing adult patients with various medical conditions and surgical interventions. You\\u2019ll dive deep into areas like cardiovascular, respiratory, gastrointestinal, and neurological systems, gaining practical knowledge to handle complex cases. With a focus on patient assessment, care planning, and post-operative care, you\'ll build a solid foundation for critical thinking and decision-making in fast-paced environments. Whether you\'re a nursing student or a practicing nurse looking to advance your expertise, this course equips you to provide exceptional, evidence-based care in a variety of healthcare settings.\"}', NULL, 0, 52, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:21:47', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 13),
(3, 0, '{\"en\":\"GERONTOLOGICAL NURSING\",\"ar\":\"GERONTOLOGICAL NURSING\",\"bn\":\"GERONTOLOGICAL NURSING\",\"es\":\"GERONTOLOGICAL NURSING\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses emphasize specialized care for older adults, focusing on their distinct physical, emotional, and social needs. This course covers skills for managing age-related conditions such as dementia, arthritis, and cardiovascular diseases, while fostering healthy aging and independence. The curriculum prioritizes patient-centered care, effective communication, and family involvement in care planning. This course equips nursing students and professionals to deliver high-quality, holistic care to the increasing elderly population. Specializing or broadening skills will equip you to enhance the quality of life for older adults.\",\"ar\":\"This course emphasizes specialized care for older adults, focusing on their distinct physical, emotional, and social needs. This course covers skills for managing age-related conditions such as dementia, arthritis, and cardiovascular diseases, while fostering healthy aging and independence. The curriculum prioritizes patient-centered care, effective communication, and family involvement in care planning. This course equips nursing students and professionals to deliver high-quality, holistic care to the increasing elderly population. Specializing or broadening skills will equip you to enhance the quality of life for older adults.\",\"bn\":\"This course emphasizes specialized care for older adults, focusing on their distinct physical, emotional, and social needs. This course covers skills for managing age-related conditions such as dementia, arthritis, and cardiovascular diseases, while fostering healthy aging and independence. The curriculum prioritizes patient-centered care, effective communication, and family involvement in care planning. This course equips nursing students and professionals to deliver high-quality, holistic care to the increasing elderly population. Specializing or broadening skills will equip you to enhance the quality of life for older adults.\",\"es\":\"This course emphasizes specialized care for older adults, focusing on their distinct physical, emotional, and social needs. This course covers skills for managing age-related conditions such as dementia, arthritis, and cardiovascular diseases, while fostering healthy aging and independence. The curriculum prioritizes patient-centered care, effective communication, and family involvement in care planning. This course equips nursing students and professionals to deliver high-quality, holistic care to the increasing elderly population. Specializing or broadening skills will equip you to enhance the quality of life for older adults.\"}', NULL, 0, 48, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:29:04', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 13),
(4, 0, '{\"en\":\"COMMUNITY HEALTH NURSING\",\"ar\":\"COMMUNITY HEALTH NURSING\",\"bn\":\"COMMUNITY HEALTH NURSING\",\"es\":\"COMMUNITY HEALTH NURSING\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses equip you to provide essential healthcare services in diverse communities, emphasizing prevention, health promotion, and education. This course covers public health principles, epidemiology, and chronic condition management in community contexts. The course focuses on evaluating community health needs, developing care plans, and advocating for at-risk populations. Skills in disaster response and communicable disease control will also be acquired. This course is designed for nursing students and professionals aiming to address health disparities and enhance well-being in community healthcare settings.\",\"ar\":\"This course equips you to provide essential healthcare services in diverse communities, emphasizing prevention, health promotion, and education. This course covers public health principles, epidemiology, and chronic condition management in community contexts. The course focuses on evaluating community health needs, developing care plans, and advocating for at-risk populations. Skills in disaster response and communicable disease control will also be acquired. This course is designed for nursing students and professionals aiming to address health disparities and enhance well-being in community healthcare settings.\",\"bn\":\"This course equips you to provide essential healthcare services in diverse communities, emphasizing prevention, health promotion, and education. This course covers public health principles, epidemiology, and chronic condition management in community contexts. The course focuses on evaluating community health needs, developing care plans, and advocating for at-risk populations. Skills in disaster response and communicable disease control will also be acquired. This course is designed for nursing students and professionals aiming to address health disparities and enhance well-being in community healthcare settings.\",\"es\":\"This course equips you to provide essential healthcare services in diverse communities, emphasizing prevention, health promotion, and education. This course covers public health principles, epidemiology, and chronic condition management in community contexts. The course focuses on evaluating community health needs, developing care plans, and advocating for at-risk populations. Skills in disaster response and communicable disease control will also be acquired. This course is designed for nursing students and professionals aiming to address health disparities and enhance well-being in community healthcare settings.\"}', NULL, 0, 44, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:33:23', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 11),
(5, 0, '{\"en\":\"MANAGEMENT IN NURSING\",\"ar\":\"MANAGEMENT\",\"bn\":\"MANAGEMENT\",\"es\":\"MANAGEMENT\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses provide essential leadership and organizational skills for managing healthcare teams and patient care effectively. This course covers healthcare administration, resource management, conflict resolution, and decision-making strategies. Understanding the role of a nurse leader facilitates workflow improvement, enhances patient outcomes, and promotes a positive work environment. This course equips aspiring and current leaders with essential tools to integrate clinical expertise and managerial responsibilities, enabling confident leadership in dynamic healthcare environments.\",\"ar\":\"This course provides essential leadership and organizational skills for managing healthcare teams and patient care effectively. This course covers healthcare administration, resource management, conflict resolution, and decision-making strategies. Understanding the role of a nurse leader facilitates workflow improvement, enhances patient outcomes, and promotes a positive work environment. This course equips aspiring and current leaders with essential tools to integrate clinical expertise and managerial responsibilities, enabling confident leadership in dynamic healthcare environments.\",\"bn\":\"This course provides essential leadership and organizational skills for managing healthcare teams and patient care effectively. This course covers healthcare administration, resource management, conflict resolution, and decision-making strategies. Understanding the role of a nurse leader facilitates workflow improvement, enhances patient outcomes, and promotes a positive work environment. This course equips aspiring and current leaders with essential tools to integrate clinical expertise and managerial responsibilities, enabling confident leadership in dynamic healthcare environments.\",\"es\":\"This course provides essential leadership and organizational skills for managing healthcare teams and patient care effectively. This course covers healthcare administration, resource management, conflict resolution, and decision-making strategies. Understanding the role of a nurse leader facilitates workflow improvement, enhances patient outcomes, and promotes a positive work environment. This course equips aspiring and current leaders with essential tools to integrate clinical expertise and managerial responsibilities, enabling confident leadership in dynamic healthcare environments.\"}', NULL, 0, 40, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:40:51', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 10),
(6, 0, '{\"en\":\"OBSTETRICS\\/MATERNITY NURSING\",\"ar\":\"OBSTETRICS\\/MATERNITY\",\"bn\":\"OBSTETRICS\\/MATERNITY\",\"es\":\"OBSTETRICS\\/MATERNITY\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses address specialized care for pregnant women, newborns, and families throughout the prenatal, labor, delivery, and postpartum stages. This course provides comprehensive insights into maternal health, fetal development, labor support methods, and newborn care. This course emphasizes family-centered care, equipping you to manage routine and high-risk pregnancies, identify complications, and offer emotional support. The course prioritizes compassionate care, patient education, and teamwork within the healthcare setting. This course equips students and practicing nurses to deliver exceptional care during a critical life stage.\",\"ar\":\"This course addresses specialized care for pregnant women, newborns, and families throughout the prenatal, labor, delivery, and postpartum stages. This course provides comprehensive insights into maternal health, fetal development, labor support methods, and newborn care. This course emphasizes family-centered care, equipping you to manage routine and high-risk pregnancies, identify complications, and offer emotional support. The course prioritizes compassionate care, patient education, and teamwork within the healthcare setting. This course equips students and practicing nurses to deliver exceptional care during a critical life stage.\",\"bn\":\"This course addresses specialized care for pregnant women, newborns, and families throughout the prenatal, labor, delivery, and postpartum stages. This course provides comprehensive insights into maternal health, fetal development, labor support methods, and newborn care. This course emphasizes family-centered care, equipping you to manage routine and high-risk pregnancies, identify complications, and offer emotional support. The course prioritizes compassionate care, patient education, and teamwork within the healthcare setting. This course equips students and practicing nurses to deliver exceptional care during a critical life stage.\",\"es\":\"This course addresses specialized care for pregnant women, newborns, and families throughout the prenatal, labor, delivery, and postpartum stages. This course provides comprehensive insights into maternal health, fetal development, labor support methods, and newborn care. This course emphasizes family-centered care, equipping you to manage routine and high-risk pregnancies, identify complications, and offer emotional support. The course prioritizes compassionate care, patient education, and teamwork within the healthcare setting. This course equips students and practicing nurses to deliver exceptional care during a critical life stage.\"}', NULL, 0, 36, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 12:46:06', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 11),
(7, 0, '{\"en\":\"PEDIATRICS NURSING\",\"ar\":\"PEDIATRICS NURSING\",\"bn\":\"PEDIATRICS NURSING\",\"es\":\"PEDIATRICS NURSING\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses aim to equip participants with the knowledge and skills necessary for specialized care of infants, children, and adolescents. This course covers pediatric growth and development, prevalent childhood illnesses, and family-centered care methods. The courses address acute and chronic conditions, pediatric assessments, and the emotional and psychological support for young patients and their families. This program emphasizes communication, advocacy, and compassionate care, equipping you to foster a supportive environment for children in diverse healthcare contexts. This course equips nursing students and professionals to effectively contribute to pediatric care.\",\"ar\":\"This course aims to equip participants with the knowledge and skills necessary for specialized care of infants, children, and adolescents. This course covers pediatric growth and development, prevalent childhood illnesses, and family-centered care methods. The courses address acute and chronic conditions, pediatric assessments, and the emotional and psychological support for young patients and their families. This program emphasizes communication, advocacy, and compassionate care, equipping you to foster a supportive environment for children in diverse healthcare contexts. This course equips nursing students and professionals to effectively contribute to pediatric care.\",\"bn\":\"This course aims to equip participants with the knowledge and skills necessary for specialized care of infants, children, and adolescents. This course covers pediatric growth and development, prevalent childhood illnesses, and family-centered care methods. The courses address acute and chronic conditions, pediatric assessments, and the emotional and psychological support for young patients and their families. This program emphasizes communication, advocacy, and compassionate care, equipping you to foster a supportive environment for children in diverse healthcare contexts. This course equips nursing students and professionals to effectively contribute to pediatric care.\",\"es\":\"This course aims to equip participants with the knowledge and skills necessary for specialized care of infants, children, and adolescents. This course covers pediatric growth and development, prevalent childhood illnesses, and family-centered care methods. The courses address acute and chronic conditions, pediatric assessments, and the emotional and psychological support for young patients and their families. This program emphasizes communication, advocacy, and compassionate care, equipping you to foster a supportive environment for children in diverse healthcare contexts. This course equips nursing students and professionals to effectively contribute to pediatric care.\"}', NULL, 0, 31, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 13:09:48', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 11),
(8, 0, '{\"en\":\"PSYCHIATRIC\\/MENTAL HEALTH NURSING\",\"ar\":\"PSYCHIATRIC\\/MENTAL HEALTH NURSING\",\"bn\":\"PSYCHIATRIC\\/MENTAL HEALTH NURSING\",\"es\":\"PSYCHIATRIC\\/MENTAL HEALTH NURSING\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses provide skills for delivering compassionate, evidence-based care to individuals with mental health challenges. These courses cover psychiatric disorders, therapeutic communication, crisis intervention, and mental health assessments. The courses prioritize patient-centered care, concentrating on individuals with anxiety, depression, schizophrenia, and substance use disorders. Learn to collaborate with multidisciplinary teams and advocate for mental health awareness. These courses equip nursing students and professionals specializing in mental health to provide empathetic care and support to patients across various settings.\",\"ar\":\"These courses provide skills for delivering compassionate, evidence-based care to individuals with mental health challenges. These courses cover psychiatric disorders, therapeutic communication, crisis intervention, and mental health assessments. The courses prioritize patient-centered care, concentrating on individuals with anxiety, depression, schizophrenia, and substance use disorders. Learn to collaborate with multidisciplinary teams and advocate for mental health awareness. These courses equip nursing students and professionals specializing in mental health to provide empathetic care and support to patients across various settings.\",\"bn\":\"These courses provide skills for delivering compassionate, evidence-based care to individuals with mental health challenges. These courses cover psychiatric disorders, therapeutic communication, crisis intervention, and mental health assessments. The courses prioritize patient-centered care, concentrating on individuals with anxiety, depression, schizophrenia, and substance use disorders. Learn to collaborate with multidisciplinary teams and advocate for mental health awareness. These courses equip nursing students and professionals specializing in mental health to provide empathetic care and support to patients across various settings.\",\"es\":\"These courses provide skills for delivering compassionate, evidence-based care to individuals with mental health challenges. These courses cover psychiatric disorders, therapeutic communication, crisis intervention, and mental health assessments. The courses prioritize patient-centered care, concentrating on individuals with anxiety, depression, schizophrenia, and substance use disorders. Learn to collaborate with multidisciplinary teams and advocate for mental health awareness. These courses equip nursing students and professionals specializing in mental health to provide empathetic care and support to patients across various settings.\"}', NULL, 0, 29, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 13:20:55', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 12),
(9, 0, '{\"en\":\"PHYSICAL ASSESSMENT\",\"ar\":\"PHYSICAL ASSESSMENT\",\"bn\":\"PHYSICAL ASSESSMENT\",\"es\":\"PHYSICAL ASSESSMENT\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"These courses establish a foundational understanding of comprehensive physical assessments, essential for nursing professionals. These courses will enhance your skills in systematically evaluating patients and recognizing normal and abnormal findings in different body systems. This course covers techniques for inspection, palpation, percussion, and auscultation, as well as the integration of health history and vital signs into the assessment process. These courses focus on critical thinking and clinical reasoning, equipping you to create effective care plans based on your findings. Designed for nursing students and professionals, it prepares you to provide high-quality, patient-centered care in various healthcare environments.\",\"ar\":\"These courses establish a foundational understanding of comprehensive physical assessments, essential for nursing professionals. These courses will enhance your skills in systematically evaluating patients and recognizing normal and abnormal findings in different body systems. This course covers techniques for inspection, palpation, percussion, and auscultation, as well as the integration of health history and vital signs into the assessment process. These courses focus on critical thinking and clinical reasoning, equipping you to create effective care plans based on your findings. Designed for nursing students and professionals, it prepares you to provide high-quality, patient-centered care in various healthcare environments.\",\"bn\":\"These courses establish a foundational understanding of comprehensive physical assessments, essential for nursing professionals. These courses will enhance your skills in systematically evaluating patients and recognizing normal and abnormal findings in different body systems. This course covers techniques for inspection, palpation, percussion, and auscultation, as well as the integration of health history and vital signs into the assessment process. These courses focus on critical thinking and clinical reasoning, equipping you to create effective care plans based on your findings. Designed for nursing students and professionals, it prepares you to provide high-quality, patient-centered care in various healthcare environments.\",\"es\":\"These courses establish a foundational understanding of comprehensive physical assessments, essential for nursing professionals. These courses will enhance your skills in systematically evaluating patients and recognizing normal and abnormal findings in different body systems. This course covers techniques for inspection, palpation, percussion, and auscultation, as well as the integration of health history and vital signs into the assessment process. These courses focus on critical thinking and clinical reasoning, equipping you to create effective care plans based on your findings. Designed for nursing students and professionals, it prepares you to provide high-quality, patient-centered care in various healthcare environments.\"}', NULL, 0, 25, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 13:25:41', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, 11),
(10, 0, '{\"en\":\"SAFE & EFFECTIVE CARE ENVIRONMENT\",\"ar\":\"SAFE & EFFECTIVE CARE ENVIRONMENT\",\"bn\":\"SAFE & EFFECTIVE CARE ENVIRONMENT\",\"es\":\"SAFE & EFFECTIVE CARE ENVIRONMENT\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"The courses emphasize key concepts such as patient safety, risk management, and quality improvement, you will learn to foster environments that enhance patient outcomes. The courses include infection control, task delegation, and disaster preparedness. These courses focus on legal and ethical considerations, providing skills to advocate for patients and ensure compliance with healthcare regulations. This training equips aspiring nurses to provide safe, high-quality care in diverse clinical environments, improving NCLEX preparedness.\",\"ar\":\"These Courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Safe and Effective Care Environment. Emphasizing key concepts such as patient safety, risk management, and quality improvement, you will learn to foster environments that enhance patient outcomes. The curriculum includes infection control, task delegation, and disaster preparedness. These courses focus on legal and ethical considerations, providing skills to advocate for patients and ensure compliance with healthcare regulations. This training equips aspiring nurses to provide safe, high-quality care in diverse clinical environments, improving NCLEX preparedness.\",\"bn\":\"These Courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Safe and Effective Care Environment. Emphasizing key concepts such as patient safety, risk management, and quality improvement, you will learn to foster environments that enhance patient outcomes. The curriculum includes infection control, task delegation, and disaster preparedness. These courses focus on legal and ethical considerations, providing skills to advocate for patients and ensure compliance with healthcare regulations. This training equips aspiring nurses to provide safe, high-quality care in diverse clinical environments, improving NCLEX preparedness.\",\"es\":\"These Courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Safe and Effective Care Environment. Emphasizing key concepts such as patient safety, risk management, and quality improvement, you will learn to foster environments that enhance patient outcomes. The curriculum includes infection control, task delegation, and disaster preparedness. These courses focus on legal and ethical considerations, providing skills to advocate for patients and ensure compliance with healthcare regulations. This training equips aspiring nurses to provide safe, high-quality care in diverse clinical environments, improving NCLEX preparedness.\"}', NULL, 0, 18, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 13:48:30', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, NULL),
(11, 0, '{\"en\":\"HEALTH PROMOTION & MAINTENANCE\",\"ar\":\"HEALTH PROMOTION & MAINTENANCE\",\"bn\":\"HEALTH PROMOTION & MAINTENANCE\",\"es\":\"HEALTH PROMOTION & MAINTENANCE\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"The courses will provide insights into strategies for promoting wellness and preventing disease in different age groups. The courses focus on health assessment, nutrition, exercise, and patient education to promote healthy lifestyles. Learn to create individualized care plans focusing on preventive measures, risk factors, and health screenings. These courses enhance your skills in evidence-based practices and community health initiatives, empowering patients in their health journey and improving your confidence and competence for the NCLEX exam.\",\"ar\":\"These courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Health Promotion and Maintenance. This will provide insights into strategies for promoting wellness and preventing disease in different age groups. The courses focus on health assessment, nutrition, exercise, and patient education to promote healthy lifestyles. Learn to create individualized care plans focusing on preventive measures, risk factors, and health screenings. These courses enhance your skills in evidence-based practices and community health initiatives, empowering patients in their health journey and improving your confidence and competence for the NCLEX exam.\",\"bn\":\"These courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Health Promotion and Maintenance. This will provide insights into strategies for promoting wellness and preventing disease in different age groups. The courses focus on health assessment, nutrition, exercise, and patient education to promote healthy lifestyles. Learn to create individualized care plans focusing on preventive measures, risk factors, and health screenings. These courses enhance your skills in evidence-based practices and community health initiatives, empowering patients in their health journey and improving your confidence and competence for the NCLEX exam.\",\"es\":\"These courses prepare nursing students for the NCLEX test plan category of Health Promotion and Maintenance. This will provide insights into strategies for promoting wellness and preventing disease in different age groups. The courses focus on health assessment, nutrition, exercise, and patient education to promote healthy lifestyles. Learn to create individualized care plans focusing on preventive measures, risk factors, and health screenings. These courses enhance your skills in evidence-based practices and community health initiatives, empowering patients in their health journey and improving your confidence and competence for the NCLEX exam.\"}', NULL, 0, 13, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 14:36:47', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, NULL),
(12, 0, '{\"en\":\"PSYCHOSOCIAL INTEGRITY\",\"ar\":\"PSYCHOSOCIAL INTEGRITY\",\"bn\":\"PSYCHOSOCIAL INTEGRITY\",\"es\":\"PSYCHOSOCIAL INTEGRITY\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"The courses emphasize the emotional, social, and mental well-being of patients, covering essential topics like mental health disorders, therapeutic communication, and crisis intervention. The courses highlight the significance of understanding patient behaviors, coping strategies, and cultural influences on mental health. Learn to evaluate psychosocial needs and create care plans that enhance emotional support and resilience. These courses enhance your advocacy and patient education skills, enabling you to deliver compassionate, holistic care and improving your preparedness for the NCLEX exam.\",\"ar\":\"These courses emphasize the emotional, social, and mental well-being of patients, covering essential topics like mental health disorders, therapeutic communication, and crisis intervention. The courses highlight the significance of understanding patient behaviors, coping strategies, and cultural influences on mental health. Learn to evaluate psychosocial needs and create care plans that enhance emotional support and resilience. These courses enhance your advocacy and patient education skills, enabling you to deliver compassionate, holistic care and improving your preparedness for the NCLEX exam.\",\"bn\":\"These courses emphasize the emotional, social, and mental well-being of patients, covering essential topics like mental health disorders, therapeutic communication, and crisis intervention. The courses highlight the significance of understanding patient behaviors, coping strategies, and cultural influences on mental health. Learn to evaluate psychosocial needs and create care plans that enhance emotional support and resilience. These courses enhance your advocacy and patient education skills, enabling you to deliver compassionate, holistic care and improving your preparedness for the NCLEX exam.\",\"es\":\"These courses emphasize the emotional, social, and mental well-being of patients, covering essential topics like mental health disorders, therapeutic communication, and crisis intervention. The courses highlight the significance of understanding patient behaviors, coping strategies, and cultural influences on mental health. Learn to evaluate psychosocial needs and create care plans that enhance emotional support and resilience. These courses enhance your advocacy and patient education skills, enabling you to deliver compassionate, holistic care and improving your preparedness for the NCLEX exam.\"}', NULL, 0, 7, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 14:42:01', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, NULL),
(13, 0, '{\"en\":\"PHYSIOLOGICAL INTEGRITY\",\"ar\":\"PHYSIOLOGICAL INTEGRITY\",\"bn\":\"PHYSIOLOGICAL INTEGRITY\",\"es\":\"PHYSIOLOGICAL INTEGRITY\"}', 1, NULL, '{\"en\":\"The courses prepare nursing students to acquire essential knowledge for assessing and managing patients\' physical health across various medical conditions. The courses address essential topics including anatomy, physiology, pathophysiology, and pharmacology, highlighting the significance of holistic patient care. Learn to interpret lab results, identify signs of physiological distress, and apply evidence-based interventions to facilitate recovery. These courses enhance critical thinking and clinical reasoning skills, enabling safe and effective delivery of care while boosting your confidence and competence in preparation for the NCLEX exam.\",\"ar\":\"The courses prepare nursing students to acquire essential knowledge for assessing and managing patients\' physical health across various medical conditions. The courses address essential topics including anatomy, physiology, pathophysiology, and pharmacology, highlighting the significance of holistic patient care. Learn to interpret lab results, identify signs of physiological distress, and apply evidence-based interventions to facilitate recovery. These courses enhance critical thinking and clinical reasoning skills, enabling safe and effective delivery of care while boosting your confidence and competence in preparation for the NCLEX exam.\",\"bn\":\"The courses prepare nursing students to acquire essential knowledge for assessing and managing patients\' physical health across various medical conditions. The courses address essential topics including anatomy, physiology, pathophysiology, and pharmacology, highlighting the significance of holistic patient care. Learn to interpret lab results, identify signs of physiological distress, and apply evidence-based interventions to facilitate recovery. These courses enhance critical thinking and clinical reasoning skills, enabling safe and effective delivery of care while boosting your confidence and competence in preparation for the NCLEX exam.\",\"es\":\"The courses prepare nursing students to acquire essential knowledge for assessing and managing patients\' physical health across various medical conditions. The courses address essential topics including anatomy, physiology, pathophysiology, and pharmacology, highlighting the significance of holistic patient care. Learn to interpret lab results, identify signs of physiological distress, and apply evidence-based interventions to facilitate recovery. These courses enhance critical thinking and clinical reasoning skills, enabling safe and effective delivery of care while boosting your confidence and competence in preparation for the NCLEX exam.\"}', NULL, 0, 22, NULL, NULL, '2024-10-19 14:53:32', '2025-07-29 02:13:24', 1, NULL),
