(30, 114, 17, NULL, 'Lesson 1.1: Role of a Nurse in Patient Care', 'Nurses play an integral role in a patient\'s journey. They play multiples roles which can vary from taking care of wounds to being a pillar of emotional support. Nurses truly are the backbone of a healthcare system and the ones who can make a big impact with a small act.', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BiTtIRJRN_o&ab_channel=AgaKhanUniversityHospitalPakistan', 'Youtube', '0', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-21 03:34:57', '2025-08-21 03:34:57', 999999, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(31, 114, 17, NULL, 'Lesson 1.2: Understanding Patient Needs and Rights', 'Covers essential skills for supporting patients in daily care, ensuring comfort, hygiene, mobility, and safety. Students also learn effective patient communication.', 'public/uploads/file/21-08-2025/33b4fc9b170b3bef943215bd08577815.docx', 'Self', '0', 1, 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-21 03:37:05', '2025-08-21 03:37:05', 999999, 1, 0, NULL, 1277.31, 1277.31, 23),
