(5, '{\"en\":\"Assistive Devices\",\"ar\":\"Assistive Devices\",\"bn\":\"Assistive Devices\",\"es\":\"Assistive Devices\"}', 80, '{\"en\":\"Follow these instructions carefully to complete your quiz successfully!\\r\\n1. Read Each Question Carefully\\r\\n\\u2022\\tTake your time to understand the question before selecting an answer.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tPay attention to keywords like best, first, most important, or priority.\\r\\n2. Choose the Best Answer\\r\\n\\u2022\\tSome questions may have multiple correct answers, but you must select the most appropriate one.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tUse critical thinking and nursing knowledge to make the best choice.\\r\\n3. Manage Your Time Wisely\\r\\n\\u2022\\tKeep an eye on the clock to ensure you complete all questions.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tIf you\\u2019re unsure about a question, mark it and return to it later.\\r\\n4. Follow Any Specific Instructions\\r\\n\\u2022\\tIf the quiz has multiple sections (e.g., multiple-choice, true\\/false, fill-in-the-blank), complete each section as directed.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tSome questions may require more than one response\\u2014read carefully!\\r\\n5. Submit Your Quiz on Time\\r\\n\\u2022\\tDouble-check your answers before submitting.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tEnsure you have answered all required questions.\\r\\n6. Do Not Use Unauthorized Resources\\r\\n\\u2022\\tNo textbooks, notes, or online searches unless explicitly allowed.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tFollow the academic integrity policy\\u2014no cheating or sharing answers.\\r\\n7. Stay Focused and Confident!\\r\\n\\u2022\\tTrust your knowledge and training.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tStay calm and do your best\\u2014you\\u2019ve got this! \\ud83d\\udcaa\\r\\nGood luck!\",\"ar\":\"Follow these instructions carefully to complete your quiz successfully!\\r\\n1. Read Each Question Carefully\\r\\n\\u2022\\tTake your time to understand the question before selecting an answer.\\r\\n\\u2022\\tPay attention to keywords like best, first, most important, or priority.\\r\\n2. Choose the Best Answer\\