(9, '{\"en\":\"Chapter Quiz: Patient Hygiene and Safety\",\"es\":\"\"}', 60, '{\"en\":\"Each quiz contains 20 multiple-choice questions and may include short-answer questions depending on the chapter.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou must complete the quiz within the time limit (30 minutes for chapter quizzes, 60 minutes for midterms, 90 minutes for finals).\\r\\n\\r\\nNo external material, textbooks, or notes are allowed during quizzes, unless otherwise stated.\\r\\n\\r\\nEach question carries 1 point unless specified.\\r\\n\\r\\nPractical exams will be evaluated through demonstrations, simulations, or role-play scenarios.\\r\\n\\r\\nOnce submitted, quizzes cannot be re-attempted unless permitted by the instructor.\\r\\n\\r\\nEach quiz contains 20 multiple-choice questions and may include short-answer questions depending on the chapter.\",\"es\":\"\"}', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2025-08-21 03:39:33', '2025-08-21 03:39:33', 11, 7, 114, 1, 1, 1, 1, 0, 2, 1, 0, 1, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 1),
