(8, '1', 'National Factors Administrator', 'Corporate Creative Administrator', 'Consequatur voluptatibus itaque veritatis necessitatibus.', '<p>A <strong>Database System</strong> is software that helps to <strong>store, organize, and manage data</strong> in a structured way so it can be <strong>easily accessed, updated, and secured</strong>.</p><ul><li><strong>Key Topics:</strong><ul><li><strong>Data Models:</strong> how data is represented (tables, objects).</li><li><strong>SQL (Structured Query Language):</strong> used to insert, update, delete, and search data.</li><li><strong>Database Design:</strong> creating tables, relationships, primary &amp; foreign keys.</li><li><strong>Normalization:</strong> reducing redundancy and improving efficiency.</li><li><strong>Transactions:</strong> ensure data consistency (commit, rollback).</li><li><strong>Security:</strong> controlling access with users and permissions.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Examples:</strong> MySQL, Oracle, Microsoft SQL Server, PostgreSQL.</li></ul>', 300.00, 10.00, 'percent', 10.00, 327.00, 27.00, 30.00, 10, '', '', '0000-00-00', NULL, '1', '2025-09-23 06:11:57', '2025-09-26 01:22:12', NULL, 1),
