(50, '{\"en\":\"First class\"}', 'Academic Prerequisites:\r\n\r\nBasic understanding of computers and operating systems\r\n\r\nPrior experience with any programming logic (like C, Python, or pseudocode) — optional but helpful\r\n\r\nTechnical Requirements:\r\n\r\nLaptop or PC (minimum 4GB RAM recommended)\r\n\r\nInstalled Java Development Kit (JDK 17 or higher)\r\n\r\nIntegrated Development Environment (IDE): IntelliJ IDEA / Eclipse / NetBeans / VS Code\r\n\r\nInternet connection (for library access, dependencies, and tutorials)\r\n\r\nTextbooks & References:\r\n\r\nJava: The Complete Reference by Herbert Schildt\r\n\r\nHead First Java by Kathy Sierra & Bert Bates\r\n\r\nEffective Java by Joshua Bloch\r\n\r\nOracle Java Documentation (https://docs.oracle.com/javase\r\n)\r\nFi First classFirst classFirst classrst class', '20', NULL, NULL, '74', 46, 0.00, 1, '2025-11-03', '2025-11-04', '03:30:00', '03:50:00', 'Tue', 'public/uploads/main/images/03-11-2025/6908996b476ae.jpeg', 'Team', 19, 1, '2025-11-03 08:00:43', '2025-11-03 08:00:43', 1, 2, '[\"program\"]', 'true', 8, 9717),
